### Portfolio of user 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolio
X-User-Id: 1

### Empty portfolio of user 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolio
X-User-Id: 2

### Unknown user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/portfolio
X-User-Id: 999

### Administrator portfolio lookup (demo)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/internal/users/1/portfolio
X-Role: ADMIN

### The same internal route without the administrator role
GET http://localhost:8080/api/internal/users/1/portfolio
